# Vercel Environment Variables

Create a `.env.local` file with:

```
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
```

For local development (uses local backend).

## Vercel Dashboard

In your Vercel project settings, set the environment variable:

**Name:** `VITE_API_URL`
**Value:** `https://your-app.vercel.app` (your actual Vercel domain)

This way, the frontend will call the backend API functions on the same domain when deployed.
